flowchart TD
    A[Need or meal occasion] --> B[Discover: search or category]
    B --> C[Compare menu, total cost and ETA]
    C --> D{Confident choice?}
    D -- No --> B
    D -- Yes --> E[Cart and checkout validation]
    E --> F{Price and availability valid?}
    F -- No --> C
    F -- Yes --> G[Order confirmed]
    G --> H[Restaurant preparation and delivery]
    H --> I{Delivered successfully?}
    I -- Yes --> J[Feedback and repeat]
    I -- No --> K[Clear recovery and support]
    K --> J
